1
00:00:00,661 --> 00:00:02,241
[TOY BLARING MUSIC]

2
00:00:02,413 --> 00:00:04,203
Oh, for God sakes.

3
00:00:04,373 --> 00:00:05,873
[MUSIC STOPS]

4
00:00:06,042 --> 00:00:07,872
(Leonard:)So you have childhood issues.

5
00:00:08,044 --> 00:00:09,794
(Leonard:)We all have childhood issues.

6
00:00:09,962 --> 00:00:12,802
(Leonard:)At some point, you just need to grow up
and get past them.

7
00:00:12,965 --> 00:00:14,095
TOY:
Fire. Fire.

8
00:00:14,258 --> 00:00:15,388
[LASER SOUND EFFECTS FIRING]

9
00:00:15,551 --> 00:00:17,131
Leonard, let me handle this. Please?

10
00:00:17,303 --> 00:00:20,183
-Fire, fire.
-Look, let-- She--

11
00:00:20,347 --> 00:00:22,267
[TOY CONTINUES INDISTINCTLY]

12
00:00:23,267 --> 00:00:24,597
[TOY STOPS]

13
00:00:25,853 --> 00:00:28,313
Sheldon, please try and understand.

14
00:00:28,481 --> 00:00:32,651
Look, Leonard and I are in a relationship
and occasionally we're gonna fight.

15
00:00:32,818 --> 00:00:36,908
But no matter what happens
between us, we will always love you.

16
00:00:38,908 --> 00:00:40,328
Right, Leonard?

17
00:00:40,826 --> 00:00:42,826
(Leonard:)Always is a long time.

18
00:00:44,872 --> 00:00:46,832
(Leonard:)Sure. Always.

19
00:00:46,999 --> 00:00:51,299
(Penny:)You know, how about we buy you
this robot and then we all go home?

20
00:00:51,962 --> 00:00:53,962
(Sheldon:)I want that one.

21
00:00:54,465 --> 00:00:56,095
(Penny:)Okay, you can have that one.

22
00:00:56,258 --> 00:00:58,758
(Leonard:)Oh, come on.
He's just gonna play with it twice...

